# SD Pipeline Rules
# D&D Real-Time Image Generation Pipeline Rules

这份文档定义了 Stable Diffusion API 在 D&D 跑团自动化系统中的模型路由逻辑、渲染参数与 Prompt 拼接规则。

---

## 1. 场景路由与模型选择 (Model Routing)

根据 DM 生成的剧情事件类型，自动切换至对应的 Checkpoint/LoRA 及参数配置。

| 场景类型 (Scene Type) | 推荐 Checkpoint / LoRA | 目标风格 | 核心优势 |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **角色 / NPC / 实时对话** | `DreamShaper 8 LCM` + `<lora:DD_Painterly:1>` | D&D 5e 官方规则书插画风 | 极速响应（<1s），极佳的手绘质感 |
| **战术地图 (Battlemap)** | `dndMapGenerator_v3.safetensors` | 2D 俯视战术战斗地图 | 布局清晰，支持带网格/无网格生成 |
| **剧情高潮 / 区域大地图** | `dndCoverArt_v10_SD1.safetensors` | 高精精美画册封面 / 羊皮纸大地图 | 画质极高，光影与构图具有史诗感 |

---

## 2. 各场景详细配置规范 (Configurations)

### 场景一：角色与常规剧情 (Characters & Real-time Narrative)
> **适用**：NPC 登场、玩家角色展示、实时发生的常规剧情交互。

* **Checkpoint**: `DreamShaper 8 LCM`
* **LoRA**: `<lora:DD_Painterly:1>`
* **Sampler**: `LCM` (或 `Euler a`)
* **Steps**: `6 ~ 8`
* **CFG Scale**: `1.5 ~ 2.0` *(注意：LCM 必须低 CFG)*
* **Resolution**: `512 x 768` (纵向) 或 `768 x 768`
* **Prompt Template**:
  * **Positive**: `(masterpiece, top quality:1.2), DD_Painterly, official D&D illustration style, painterly texture, {LLM_DESCRIPTION}`
  * **Negative**: `(worst quality, low quality:1.4), 3d render, smooth skin, plastic, modern clothing, ugly, lowres, watermark`

---

### 场景二：战术战斗地图 (Tactical Battlemaps)
> **适用**：进入战斗轮、地下城探索、房间/酒馆布局。

* **Checkpoint**: `dndMapGenerator_v3.safetensors`
* **Sampler**: `DPM++ 2M Karras` 或 `Euler a`
* **Steps**: `20 ~ 25`
* **CFG Scale**: `7.0`
* **Resolution**: `768 x 768` 或 `1024 x 1024` (正方形更易对齐)
* **Prompt Template**:
  * **Positive (无网格/VTT用)**: `2d dnd battlemap, top-down view, gridless, {LLM_MAP_DESCRIPTION}`
  * **Positive (自带网格/实体用)**: `2d dnd battlemap, top-down view, square grid, gridded battlemap, {LLM_MAP_DESCRIPTION}`
  * **Negative (无网格模式必须包含 grid 排除词)**: `grid, hex grid, 3d, perspective, isometric, characters, people, monsters, text, watermark, (worst quality, low quality:1.4), blurry`

---

### 场景三：剧情高潮封面与区域大地图 (Cover Art & Regional Maps)
> **适用**：章节开篇、BOSS 终局对决、高潮插画、羊皮纸世界大地图。

* **Checkpoint**: `dndCoverArt_v10_SD1.safetensors`
* **VAE**: `vae-ft-mse-840000-ema-pruned.vae.pt`
* **Sampler**: `DPM++ 2M Karras`
* **Steps**: `20`
* **CFG Scale**: `7.0`
* **Resolution**: `512 x 768` (封面) 或 `768 x 512` (大地图)
* **Prompt Template**:
  * **剧情高潮插画**:
    * **Positive**: `dnd cover art, book cover illustration, official D&D style, epic cinematic fantasy, {LLM_EPIC_DESCRIPTION}`
    * **Negative**: `text, title, logo, watermark, typography, signature, words, (worst quality, low quality:1.4), 3d render`
  * **羊皮纸区域大地图**:
    * **Positive**: `dnd cover art, 2d dnd map, fantasy regional map, top-down view, aged parchment style, cartography style, detailed terrain, {LLM_REGION_DESCRIPTION}`
    * **Negative**: `text, title, logo, watermark, signature, 3d render, photo, low quality`

